  "summary": "Command occupancy with Occ/Unocc Mode (BV 1), switch to the remote pressure setpoint with Remote Mode (BV 2) and use Emergency Mode (MV 2) for purge. Read room pressure, total supply, exhaust and hood flows, the current offset, temperature and the Status Index (MI 1) for alarms.",
